<title>LITHUANIA: TENNIS-YUGOSLAVIA LEAD LITHUANIA 3-0 DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-YUGOSLAVIA LEAD LITHUANIA 3-0 DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yugoslavia took an unbeatable 3-0 lead against Lithuania in their Davis Cup Euro/African zone group two, first round tie on Saturday.</p>
<p>Doubles result:</p>
<p>Dushan Vemic/Nenad Zimonjic (Yugoslavia) beat Rolandas Murashka/Eugenijus Cariovas (Lithuania) 6-4 6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
